name: sim.displayDialog
description: msgBox or simUI.inputDialog instead.
luaSynopsis: int dialogHandle=sim.displayDialog(string titleText,string mainText,int dialogType,bool modalDialog,string initialText)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. titleText: Title bar text
2. mainText: information text
3. dialogType: generic dialog style
4. modalDialog: specifies whether the dialog is modal. Modal dialogs are only allowed when not called from the main thread.
5. initialText: Initial text in the edit box if the dialog is of type sim.dlgstyle_input. Can be nil or omitted
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. dialogHandle: handle of generic dialog
